.el .ds Aq '
.TH AMIVULN-CONFIG 1  "config " 
.SH NAME
config \- Show, create or validate the configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBconfig\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show, create or validate the configuration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
config\-show(1)
Print the effective configuration
.TP
config\-init(1)
Write a commented default configuration file
.TP
config\-validate(1)
Load the configuration and report problems
.TP
config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
